print the returned string so I can inspect its structure.                                                               
                                                                                                                        
Step 2 - SCREENING: I will pass the librarian’s output and the review data to the gatekeeper to get INCLUDE/EXCLUDE     
decisions. I will print the gatekeeper’s output.                                                                        
                                                                                                                        
Step 3 - Parse included studies: I will use regex to extract the indices of included studies from the gatekeeper output.
Then I will extract title and abstract for each included study from the original review JSON (using regex) and build a  
JSON string listing included studies with fields: study_index, title, abstract. I will also extract the objective from  
the review JSON for downstream tools.                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
Step 4 - EXTRACTION: I will call the miner with the included studies JSON and the review objective to extract PICO      
evidence. I will print the miner’s output.                                                                              
                                                                                                                        
Step 5 - SYNTHESIS: I will call the critic with the extracted evidence and the objective to obtain a narrative synthesis
and quality assessment. I will print the critic’s output.                                                               
                                                                                                                        
Step 6 - REPORT: I will compute:                                                                                        
- Number of candidate studies (count study_index occurrences in librarian result).                                      
- Screening results (included/excluded counts and decisions).                                                           
- Summarize key PICO elements per included study from miner output (or include miner’s structured summary).             
- Include critic’s synthesis and quality assessment.                                                                    
Finally, I will compile and return the final structured report.                                                         
                                                                                                                        
