=== BATCH SCREENING TASK ===
Review: Cotrimoxazole prophylaxis for opportunistic infections in children with HIV infection
Total studies to screen: 10

SELECTION CRITERIA:
Randomised or quasi‐randomised trials comparing routinely administered cotrimoxazole versus placebo or no treatment in 
